{
  "summary": "The checkout-api is experiencing elevated timeout rates due to connection attempts on the legacy port 5432, which was moved to 6432 in a recent migration. The redis-session-cache is healthy and not the cause. The stack trace confirms timeouts on the old port, and the latency histogram shows all failed requests hitting the timeout ceiling. The next step is to update the checkout-api configuration to use the new port 6432."
}

{
  "summary": "The auth-gateway is experiencing elevated timeout rates due to its configuration still pointing to the legacy port 8080, while the token-signer's mTLS listener was recently moved to port 8443. The ldap-directory-sync service is healthy and not the cause. Stack traces and latency metrics confirm that all failed requests are timing out on the old port, indicating a misconfiguration in the auth-gateway's upstream port setting."
}

{
